@0    = ~Yes? Oh you wish for us to part company? I would like to stay with you.~ [NINA02]
@1    = ~No, stay with the party for now.~
@2    = ~Just wait here awhile, Nina.~
@3    = ~I'll send you back to the pocket plane...wait there.~
